   "kind": "page",
   "heading": "直角坐标系",
   "narration": "把矢量式写成分量式，最常用的是直角坐标系：F 等于 m 乘 d v 比 d t，可以按三个方向拆开，x 方向是 m 乘 d v x 比 d t 再乘 i，y 方向乘 j，z 方向乘 k。因为 a 也这样分解，所以有 F 等于 m a x 乘 i 加 m a y 乘 j 加 m a z 乘 k。写成方程组就是 F x 等于 m a x，F y 等于 m a y，F z 等于 m a z。",
   "elements": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "step": 0,
     "x": 170,
     "y": 137,
     "w": 1580,
     "h": 90,
     "align": "left",
     "valign": "center",
     "paras": [
      [
       {
        "t": "1　在直角坐标系中",
        "size": 52,
        "color": "#C00000",
        "b": true
       }
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "tex",
     "step": 1,
     "x": 170,
     "y": 280,
     "w": 1580,
     "h": 110,
     "tex": "\\vec F=m\\dfrac{\\mathrm{d}\\vec v}{\\mathrm{d}t}=m\\dfrac{\\mathrm{d}v_x}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\vec i+m\\dfrac{\\mathrm{d}v_y}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\vec j+m\\dfrac{\\mathrm{d}v_z}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\vec k",
     "size": 46,
     "color": "#111111",
     "align": "center"
    },
    {
     "type": "tex",
     "step": 2,
     "x": 170,
     "y": 470,
     "w": 1580,
     "h": 110,
     "tex": "\\text{即}\\quad\\vec F=m a_x\\vec i+m a_y\\vec j+m a_z\\vec k",
     "size": 46,
     "color": "#111111",
     "align": "center"
    },
    {
     "type": "tex",
     "step": 3,
     "x": 170,
     "y": 640,
     "w": 1580,
     "h": 110,
     "tex": "\\begin{cases}F_x=m a_x\\\\[4pt]F_y=m a_y\\\\[4pt]F_z=m a_z\\end{cases}",
     "size": 46,
     "color": "#111111",
     "align": "center",
     "important": true,
     "hotspot": true,
     "label": "分量式",
     "qa": [
